OL,3,GNEWSA'Wise and resilient matriarch'
OL,4,AMabel the chimpanzee dies aged 60
OL,5,
OL,6,FA zoo in Wales has announced the death
OL,7,Fof its oldest chimpanzee, Mabel,
OL,8,Ffollowing a "short period of
OL,9,Fage-related decline".
OL,11,FWelsh Mountain Zoo in Colwyn Bay,
OL,12,FConwy, announced the death of the
OL,13,F60-year-old chimp on social media with
OL,14,F"great sadness".
OL,16,F"Mabel will be greatly missed by
OL,17,Feveryone who was lucky enough to know
OL,18,Fand work with her," it said.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
