OL,3,GNEWSA'Wise and resilient matriarch'
OL,4,AMabel the chimpanzee dies aged 60
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe zoo said Mabel was "part of life at
OL,7,FWelsh Mountain Zoo for many years", and
OL,8,Fhad made an "incredibly valuable
OL,9,Fcontribution" to a breeding programme
OL,10,Frun by the European Association of Zoos
OL,11,Fand Aquaria (EAZA) for the critically
OL,12,Fendangered Western chimpanzee.
